{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Serious Sally",
    "steam_appid": 1971120,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971120/extras/e640d2cdf5a1ea56e8ca46eeaa543680.avif?t=1688114188\" /></div><br><br>Serious Sally is the type of game that old-school fans of the FPS genre really love. It retains the feel of classic shooter gameplay while being graphically modern.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main features of the game:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>First-person camera<br></li><li>Classic old-school FPS gameplay in the atmosphere of ancient Egypt<br></li><li>Hordes of the undead monsters to waste them all<br></li><li>12 different game levels<br></li><li>Interesting storyline<br></li><li>Seven types of weapons<br></li><li>Health and armor system<br></li><li>Pickups with mega boosters<br></li><li>In-game achievements</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971120/extras/294818dd465f6edb1033f7e189fae1ed.avif?t=1688114188\" /></div><br><br>Travel through ancient Egypt and kill all kinds of dangerous monsters for fun and profit!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971120/extras/a11e24e056e918eb39bb218e5b7ee551.avif?t=1688114188\" /></div><br><br>Are you serious enough to go on this journey?<br><br>P. S. Message for Dad:<br>Dad, why don't you go to Egypt anymore? We've been waiting for it for so many years... and there's not a single sign that you're going there again :(  Well, if you don't want to, I've decided to go there myself.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971120/extras/e640d2cdf5a1ea56e8ca46eeaa543680.avif?t=1688114188\" /></div><br><br>Serious Sally is the type of game that old-school fans of the FPS genre really love. It retains the feel of classic shooter gameplay while being graphically modern.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main features of the game:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>First-person camera<br></li><li>Classic old-school FPS gameplay in the atmosphere of ancient Egypt<br></li><li>Hordes of the undead monsters to waste them all<br></li><li>12 different game levels<br></li><li>Interesting storyline<br></li><li>Seven types of weapons<br></li><li>Health and armor system<br></li><li>Pickups with mega boosters<br></li><li>In-game achievements</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971120/extras/294818dd465f6edb1033f7e189fae1ed.avif?t=1688114188\" /></div><br><br>Travel through ancient Egypt and kill all kinds of dangerous monsters for fun and profit!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971120/extras/a11e24e056e918eb39bb218e5b7ee551.avif?t=1688114188\" /></div><br><br>Are you serious enough to go on this journey?<br><br>P. S. Message for Dad:<br>Dad, why don't you go to Egypt anymore? We've been waiting for it for so many years... and there's not a single sign that you're going there again :(  Well, if you don't want to, I've decided to go there myself.",
    "short_description": "Serious Sally is the daughter of a very serious man. She wants to be just like her father. Her adventure is for you to follow in this old-school first-person shooter created with respect for the good old classic games of the genre. Just pure fun and violence for those who love it.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
